// Matching on canonicals: use input="canonical" to find an entity by its
// canonical, so that variants and pronouns follow. The entity domain has to run
// first, as it sets the canonicals.
//
// Text: "Emmanuel Macron won the elections. He was happy about it. The main opponent of Macron was Marine Le Pen."
// matches: Emmanuel Macron, He, Macron

lexicon: (input="canonical") { Joe Biden, Emmanuel Macron, Boris Johnson } = President;
